# The build context is build-env/rust-check/, and the only thing this image
# needs out of it is the filtered lock build-env/build.sh writes there.
# Everything else is excluded by default rather than by enumeration -- an
# allow-list cannot be outgrown by a file somebody adds later, and this is the
# same shape pkgs/rauc/Dockerfile.dockerignore uses.
*
!images.lock
